  - m_Id: 2846564754866176
    m_Localized: "Thank you for playing my game. Pinball Rouge is a Top-Down Shooter
      game with pinball like bullets and all kinds of power-ups with costomizable
      builds. While this whole game was developed in a rush and all done by myself,
      I am sorry to have all kinds of bugs flying  around. Here are some provided
      console to prevent from stuck in any wierd bugs.\nJust write name the first
      box and the parameters (if any) on the lower box.  \n\nAddCard(int cardId)
      : Get any card of the cardId provided\nLevelCleared() : Clear the level \nLevelStart()
      : Start the level\nAddCoin(int coin) : Give you any amount of coin\nAddExp(int
      exp) : Gain any expierence points\nKillAllEnemies() : Instantly kill all enemies\nSetEnemyHealth(float
      modifier) : Set health modifier of all enemies (e.g. 1.5 means all enemy have
      x1.5 health)\nSetEnemyDamage(float modifier) : Set damage modifier, same as
      health\nSetMaxHealth(float maxHealth) : Set the maxHealth of player\nLose()
      / Win() : Instantly win or Lose the game"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2846564784226304
    m_Localized: 'Main Developer: David Zhu


      Codes: Copilot


      Localizations:
      ChatGPT Translator


      Addon Packages:

      Unity Localization Pack 
      com.unity.localization

      Dialouge Editor https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/p/dialogue-editor-168329

      Dotween:
      https://dotween.demigiant.com/

      Odin Inspector: https://odininspector.com/


      Art
      and Animations:

