      craftpix.net

      https://pixelfrog-assets.itch.io/tiny-swords

      https://cupnooble.itch.io/sprout-lands-asset-pack

      https://pixelfrog-assets.itch.io/pixel-adventure-1

      https://cupnooble.itch.io/sprout-lands-ui-pack

      https://shikashipx.itch.io/shikashis-fantasy-icons-pack

      https://bdragon1727.itch.io/

      https://monopixelart.itch.io/skeletons-pack

      https://pimen.itch.io/holy-spell-effect

      https://9e0.itch.io/witches-pack


      UI
      and Fonts:

      https://www.creativefabrica.com/ref/53/

      https://www.foundertype.com/index.php/FontInfo/index?id=5673

      https://www.dafont.com/grapesoda-2.font


